  <description>
    <p>
      LinOffice runs Microsoft Office in a Windows virtual machine and opens Word, Excel, PowerPoint, OneNote, and Outlook in their own windows. You need your own Windows and Microsoft Office license. Office is not included.
    </p>
    <p>
      FreeRDP, podman-compose, and PySide6 are included in this package. Podman has to be installed on the host. LinOffice uses that host Podman to run the virtual machine, and it needs access to your home directory so Office can open your files.
    </p>
  </description>
